                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the recent hospitalisation of your 73-year-old female patient, admitted on 11/10/2017 due to an acute exacerbation of her known chronic obstructive pulmonary disease. On admission, she presented with increased dyspnoea, productive cough, and reduced oxygen saturation. Chest X-ray, arterial blood gas analysis, and pulse oximetry confirmed the exacerbation. Blood tests were obtained to exclude infectious or other contributing causes. She was treated with nebulised bronchodilators, systemic corticosteroids, and supplemental oxygen therapy, with good clinical response. Vital signs were monitored regularly throughout her stay. Patient education regarding inhaler technique and exacerbation management was provided prior to discharge. She was discharged in a stable condition on 12/10/2017. I kindly ask you to continue monitoring her respiratory status and review her maintenance inhaler therapy. Please do not hesitate to contact me should you have any questions.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
